  "quote": "Neither a landlord nor a tenancy agreement shall require a tenant or prospective tenant to,",
  "reason": "Section 108(a) of the Residential Tenancies Act, 2006 prohibits a tenancy agreement from requiring a tenant to provide post-dated cheques or any other negotiable instrument for the payment of rent. Under section 4(1), any provision in a tenancy agreement that is inconsistent with the Act is void."
